1
00:00:00,098 --> 00:00:02,428
(Stuart:)the high contrast
of zebra stripes might provide

2
00:00:02,434 --> 00:00:04,534
(Stuart:)better stimulus
for a developing baby.

3
00:00:05,604 --> 00:00:08,974
(Bernadette:)Yeah, you're probably right,
go with the zebras.

4
00:00:08,974 --> 00:00:10,774
(Stuart:)Good choice, boss.

5
00:00:13,144 --> 00:00:15,814
(Raj:)At least my nose
is naturally brown.

6
00:00:19,584 --> 00:00:22,054
(Bernadette:)Hey, could you please go
to the market for me?

7
00:00:22,053 --> 00:00:23,923
(Howard:)Get Stuart or Raj to do it.

8
00:00:23,922 --> 00:00:26,652
(Bernadette:)Howie, they've been doing
everything for you.

9
00:00:26,658 --> 00:00:27,958
(Howard:)Mm, I know.

10
00:00:27,959 --> 00:00:30,489
(Howard:)It's really making me
lose respect for both of them.

11
00:00:31,296 --> 00:00:33,226
(Bernadette:)Please just go to the store.

12
00:00:33,231 --> 00:00:35,931
(Leonard:)Fine.

13
00:00:35,934 --> 00:00:38,364
(Howard:)Who wants to drive me
to the store?

14
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,900
- Me!
- I'll do it!

15
00:00:39,905 --> 00:00:40,975
(Bernadette:)Take Raj.

16
00:00:40,972 --> 00:00:44,412
(Bernadette:)Stuart is supposed
to paint my toenails.

17
00:00:55,186 --> 00:00:56,186
(Raj:)What do you think?

18
00:00:56,187 --> 00:00:57,517
(Penny:)Should we go to a hotel?

19
00:00:57,522 --> 00:00:59,522
(Leonard:)And just leave
him here alone?

